      <MissionDesc>To empower learners across the U.S. to secure quality-first jobs by obtaining critical educational resources and training along the continuum of their journeys - thus driving durable economic mobility and sustainable livelihoods.</MissionDesc>
      <SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>false</SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>
